Package: cmgdr
Title: Low-Level Access to curatedMetagenomicData Public Releases
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R:
    person("Sean", "Davis", , "seandavi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8991-6458"))
Description: A small, low-level client for the public curatedMetagenomicData
    (cMD) data releases at <https://cmgd-public.cancerdatasci.org>. It finds
    datasets and immutable releases from their JSON indexes and lists their
    tables, studies and HUMAnN gene-family files. Files are downloaded into a
    cache and verified against the published SHA-256 checksums. It reads
    per-study files and sample metadata, looks up samples by run accession,
    returns release provenance, builds species TreeSummarizedExperiment
    objects, and attaches a release's read-only DuckLake catalog in DuckDB for
    SQL and dplyr queries. Higher-level packages can build on it.
